msgid "`pca()`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/spectral-indices.md:43
msgid ""
"**Principal Component Analysis** — compress N correlated bands into fewer "
"components that capture most of the variance, useful before classification"
msgstr ""
"**Análisis de componentes principales** — comprime N bandas correlacionadas "
"en menos componentes que capturan la mayor parte de la varianza, útil antes "
"de la clasificación"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/spectral-indices.md:43
msgid "Real PCA over an arbitrary input band list"
msgstr "PCA real sobre una lista arbitraria de bandas de entrada"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/spectral-indices.md:43
msgid "`texture()`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/spectral-indices.md:43
msgid ""
"**GLCM texture features** — captures spatial pattern (roughness, "
"uniformity), not just spectral value; useful for distinguishing surfaces "
"that look similar spectrally but differ in texture (e.g. urban vs. bare "
"soil)"
msgstr ""
"**Características de textura GLCM** — captura el patrón espacial (rugosidad,"
" uniformidad), no solo el valor espectral; útil para distinguir superficies "
"que se ven similares espectralmente pero difieren en textura (p. ej., urbano"
" frente a suelo desnudo)"

