msgid ""
"Needs a distinct `SWIR3` band — **not** available on Sentinel-2 or Landsat "
"(both carry only two SWIR bands total)"
msgstr ""
"Necesita una banda `SWIR3` distinta — **no** disponible en Sentinel-2 ni en "
"Landsat (ambos llevan solo dos bandas SWIR en total)"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/spectral-indices.md:613
msgid "`ALT` (Alteration)"
msgstr "`ALT` (Alteración)"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/spectral-indices.md:613
msgid "`SWIR3 / SWIR5`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/spectral-indices.md:613
msgid "Needs distinct `SWIR3` and `SWIR5` — ASTER-class sensor required"
msgstr ""
"Necesita `SWIR3` y `SWIR5` distintas — se requiere un sensor de clase ASTER"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/spectral-indices.md:613
msgid "`FEI` (Ferrous Iron)"
msgstr "`FEI` (Hierro ferroso)"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/spectral-indices.md:613
msgid "`(SWIR5 / RED) + (NIR1 / GREEN)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/spectral-indices.md:613
msgid ""
"Needs distinct `SWIR5` and `NIR1` — a sensor with multiple NIR/SWIR channels"
" (e.g. WorldView-3) required"
msgstr ""
"Necesita `SWIR5` y `NIR1` distintas — se requiere un sensor con múltiples "
"canales NIR/SWIR (p. ej., WorldView-3)"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/spectral-indices.md:613
msgid "`GOS` (Gossan)"
msgstr "`GOS` (Gossan)"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/spectral-indices.md:613
msgid "`SWIR4 / RED`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/spectral-indices.md:613
msgid "Needs a distinct `SWIR4` band — ASTER-class sensor required"
msgstr ""
"Necesita una banda `SWIR4` distinta — se requiere un sensor de clase ASTER"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/spectral-indices.md:637
msgid ""
"Only `FOX` and `AMP` work with the SWIR bands Sentinel-2/Landsat actually "
"provide. The other four are correct formulas, but need a sensor with more "
"distinct SWIR/NIR channels than the most commonly free-available sensors "
"carry — calling them with Sentinel-2 data raises a clear error naming "
"exactly which band is missing, rather than silently computing something "
"wrong with a substituted band:"
msgstr ""
"Solo `FOX` y `AMP` funcionan con las bandas SWIR que Sentinel-2/Landsat "
"realmente proporcionan. Los otros cuatro son fórmulas correctas, pero "
"necesitan un sensor con más canales SWIR/NIR distintos que los sensores "
"gratuitos más comunes — llamarlos con datos de Sentinel-2 genera un error "
"claro que nombra exactamente qué banda falta, en lugar de calcular en "
"silencio algo erróneo con una banda sustituida:"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/spectral-indices.md:650
msgid ""
"`si.info(\"AKP\")` returns the formula, required bands, and a `sensor_note` "
"explaining the same constraint in prose."
msgstr ""
"`si.info(\"AKP\")` devuelve la fórmula, las bandas requeridas y una "
"`sensor_note` que explica la misma restricción en prosa."
